    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "CODE",
      "role_note": "ClaudeCodeBeat — the naive summarize",
      "narration_text": "Read it before you trust it. All a summary does is replay the lines back to you. It loads the transcript and prints each thing that was said. Clean prose — and completely inert.",
