      "act": "CHANGE — check & revise",
      "role_note": "composer — the REQUIRED revision",
      "narration_text": "Here's the fix. Don't summarize — extract. Iterate: for every commitment, pull the owner, the task, and the due date; score impact and urgency; rank them; and flag anything with no owner or no date.",
