      "role_note": "the method + falsifiability (where it fails)",
      "narration_text": "So the method is one move you can run on any meeting: owner, task, due, ranked by impact plus urgency — and surface the gaps. Two honest limits. The tool only hears what was said: it can't invent an owner nobody volunteered, and it can mis-hear who committed — so read the list back to the room before you trust it. No source, no verdict: every action should trace to a line in the transcript.",
